## Notes
- Use SHORT SHA (7 characters) in the `commits` field
- The `commits` field can contain multiple SHAs separated by semicolons
- Dependencies should form a valid DAG (no cycles)
- Prioritize commits with meaningful changes (avoid trivial commits like "fix typo")
- Use the diff information to understand what each commit actually changes
